x &  & [\\,\\text{axiom  A3}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe axioms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{[A1]}:x+y=y+x & \\text{[A5]}:1\\cdot x=x \\\\ \\text{[A2]}:(x+y)+z=x+(y+z) & \\text{[A6]}:\\alpha (\\beta x)=(\\alpha \\beta )x \\\\ \\text{[A3]}:x+0=x & \\text{[A7]}:(\\alpha +\\beta )x=\\alpha x+\\beta x \\\\ \\text{[A4]}:x+(-x)=0 & \\text{[A8]}:\\alpha (x+y)=\\alpha x+\\alpha y\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the vector space axioms, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-x+w & =w &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ x+(-x+w) & =x+w &  & [\\,\\text{adding }x\\text{ to both sides}\\,] \\\\ (x+(-x))+w & =x+w &  & [\\,\\text{axiom }\\text{A2}\\,\\,] \\\\ 0+w & =x+w &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ w & =x+w &  & [\\,\\text{axiom  A3}\\,] \\\\ w+(-w) & =x+w+(-w) &  & [\\,\\text{adding }-w\\text{ to both sides}\\,] \\\\ w+(-w) & =x+(w+(-w)) &  & [\\,\\text{axiom  A2}\\,] \\\\ 0 & =x+0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom }\\text{A4}\\,\\,] \\\\ 0 & =x &  & [\\,\\text{axiom  A3}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-74671/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9bdb6bc9-47e2-5330-a1ee-270882f2aced"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74671"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186184704 :question/answer-fields 17592186183113] {:db/id "q-35583/selection/ma-v1/38961ba9559ca9e70a0db19d4efebeaecd2e410ce1773eebacba23f560029843/d927fdf43fe3d29557bb6fc1d96025aa696b76945eb6e9b94cdc025b6955fee7" :answer/id #uuid "b4629d94-f5d5-56ce-b7ac-559532877cca" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{A8}$, $\\text{A3}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35583/selection/ma-v1/38961ba9559ca9e70a0db19d4efebeaecd2e410ce1773eebacba23f560029843/555a2a073ef60ef8036d08ae203d2837c9203c3bdcd844cbf1a49fe6d6977236" :answer/id #uuid "6544ed62-f78f-562f-9f00-66f3b6547b4a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\text{A7}$, $\\text{A3}$" :db/ensu